  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tea Cup Diaries: Communications for Social inclusion in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will utilise a multi-media approach to tackle the divisions within Myanmar&#x2019;s society, aiming to shift attitudes and tolerance towards minority religious and ethnic groups, and build the belief that people of different backgrounds can co-exist peacefully.</narrative>
  </description>
